    "detailed_description": "<strong>Kingdoms of Lost Valleys (KoLV)</strong> is a series that brings together historical places, events, traditions, and magical creatures in a unique way. The KoLV series games tell the story of different kingdoms disputing the valley region that lies among them. In this dispute kings and generals must fight in battles/ arenas/ challenges, manage their resources, and train their armies. The Series will have TCG, RPG, and FMS games with interplay-ability. <br><br>The game is available online on the browser and mobile app and will serve a broad audience of all ages. It will be available both as P2E and F2P combining both web2 and web3 players.<br><br>Every artwork is painstakingly hand-drawn with aesthetics and design in mind.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3002170/extras/e3de2b7d26ae01cbceef9ed5bc0b7235.avif?t=1717345222\" width=576 height=124 /></span>",
